  <guid>https://citizens-initiative.europa.eu/news/15th-valid-initiative-submitted-commission-examination-2026-11-12_en</guid>
  <description>&lt;p&gt;On 12 November 2026, the organisers of the European citizens' initiative&amp;nbsp;‘Demand the full suspension of the EU-Israel Association Agreement in view of Israel’s violations of human rights’  submitted it to the European Commission for examination, after the verification phase was successfully complete&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
